# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RunPod pod config list — primary and fallback configs for pod creation
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One config file per line, in order. When creating a pod, the script tries the
# first config; if creation fails (e.g. GPU type unavailable), it tries the
# next, and so on. Paths are relative to deploy/runpod/.
#
# Example: if pod_a40.conf fails (e.g. no A40 capacity), pod_l40s.conf is tried.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

pod_a40.conf
pod_l40s.conf
